    "project": "research/bk_full_binding_audit_20261114/lean",
    "theorem": "BKFullBindingAudit.full_bk_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem full_bk_certificate : ∀ (L : Type*) [Field L] [Algebra F L] [DecidableEq L] [IsAlgClosed L], curve.Δ ≠ 0 ∧ Nat.card curve.Point = 6 ∧ Nat.Prime 3 ∧ Nat.Coprime 3 5 ∧ 3 ∣ Nat.card curve.Point ∧ ¬3 ∣ 5 - 1 ∧ (∀ k : ℕ, (∀ P : (curve.baseChange L).Point, (3 : ℕ) • P = 0 → (pointFrobenius curve)^[k] P = P) ↔ 3 ∣ 5 ^ k - 1) ∧ (∃ P : (curve.baseChange L).Point, addOrderOf P = 3 ∧ pointFrobenius curve P = -P ∧ pointFrobenius curve P ≠ P ∧ ¬∃ Q : curve.Point, rationalPointMap L Q = P) ∧ (∀ (K : Type*) [Field K] [Fintype K] [Algebra F K] [Algebra K L] [IsScalarTower F K L] [DecidableEq K] (k : ℕ), Fintype.card K = 5 ^ k → ((∀ P : (curve.baseChange L).Point, (3 : ℕ) • P = 0 → P ∈ Set.range (extensionPointMap L K)) ↔ 3 ∣ 5 ^ k - 1)) ∧ (∀ k : ℕ, 0 < k → Nat.card (GaloisField 5 k) = 5 ^ k ∧ ∃ ι : GaloisField 5 k →ₐ[F] L, (∀ P : (curve.baseChange L).Point, (3 : ℕ) • P = 0 → P ∈ Set.range (galoisPointMap L k ι)) ↔ 3 ∣ 5 ^ k - 1)",
    "decl_sha256": "255334b4de88ddc92803431efa042b40aa02db63affd414666c7a20c01cb02ed",
    "scope": "Complete written-type versioned wrapper for the unchanged actual E/F5:y²=x³+1 BK certificate. Explicit forall algebraically closed L/Field/Algebra F L/DecidableEq assumptions, actual curve nonsingularity/card6/r3 source conditions, every-k geometric3torsion Frobenius criterion, actual exact-order3 nonrational witness, every chosen finite extension actual point-image criterion, and actual GaloisField5k/cardinality/embedding for every positive k. Point-map helpers are definitions of actual Mathlib maps, not supplied conclusion predicates. Reuses the frozen actual-object proof, with no new general mathematical theorem or assumption of torsion rank/determinant/Hasse/Weil necessity. Repairs only the concrete old written-header receipt; original claim/source/ledger and canonical shared verifier unchanged. Independent native full-header check is separate procedural evidence, not kernel refinement of parser/hash/execution or global semantic dependency binding. Standard foundations/default settings, no holes/custom axioms/native proof evaluation/raised limits/global flags/waivers/new cryptographic experiment/paid compute/agent upload.",
